  Script path
  You can confirm the wiki's script path by adding {{SCRIPTPATH}} to a sandbox page.
  > /w

  Article path
  You can confirm the wiki's article path by adding {{ARTICLEPATH}} to a sandbox page. Omit the /$1 at the end.
  > /wiki

